<noinclude>This template takes two parameters (link=yes/no and dotted=yes/no), and creates underlined text with a hover box for many modern browsers supporting CSS.

Here are some ways to create {{H:title|also called hover-over effects or fly-out|mouse-over effects}}.

Using mouse-over effects on wiki text can improve [[w:usability|<span title="goes to the Wikipedia article about usability">usability</span>]].

==Examples==

<span title="Hello, how are you ?" >Hover over me.</span>

''Syntax:'' <nowiki>
<span title="Hello, how are you ?" >Hover over me.</span>
</nowiki>

----

'''Using: [[Template:H:title]]'''

'''The default is a dotted underline'''

{{H:title|This is mouse-over text|Hover here}}

:''Syntax:'' <nowiki>{{H:title|This is mouse-over text|Hover here}}</nowiki>
{{H:title|link=yes|This link will take you to the Main page|Main page}} (with link)

:''Syntax:'' <nowiki>{{H:title|link=yes|This link will take you to the Main page|Main page}}
</nowiki>

'''To not have a dotted underline, add ''dotted=no'''''

{{H:title|dotted=no|This is mouse-over text|Hover here}}

:''Syntax:'' <nowiki>{{H:title|dotted=no|This is mouse-over text|Hover here}}</nowiki>
{{H:title|link=yes|dotted=no|This link will take you to the Main page|Main page}} (with link)

:''Syntax:'' <nowiki>{{H:title|link=yes|dotted=no|This link will take you to the Main page|Main page}}</nowiki>

----

;Notes

[[Template:H:title]] could be further developed with a 3rd parameter to deal with the situation where one wants to create a link (page name), a link alias, and mouse-over text.

In wiki text, this can presently be done like this:

[[Wikiversity:Sandbox|<span title="mouse-over text">link alias</span>]] (note that the link goes to [[Wikiversity:Sandbox]])

:''Syntax:'' <nowiki>[[Wikiversity:Sandbox|<span title="mouse-over text">link alias</span>]] (note that the link goes to [[Wikiversity:Sandbox]])</nowiki>



</noinclude><includeonly>{{#ifeq:{{{link}}}|yes|[[{{{2}}}|<span title="{{{1}}}" {{#ifeq:{{{dotted|yes}}}|no||style="border-bottom:1px dotted"}}>{{{2}}}</span>]]|<span title="{{{1}}}" {{#ifeq:{{{dotted|yes}}}|no||style="border-bottom:1px dotted"}}>{{{2}}}</span>}}</includeonly><noinclude>[[Category:Help]]</noinclude>